    "tStartMs": 188,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你们好,我是Jade\nnǐ men hǎo, wǒ shì Jade\nHello, I'm Jade."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3908,
    "dDurationMs": 5281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "今天我穿了一件红色的\njīn tiān wǒ chuān le yī jiàn hóng sè de\nToday I'm wearing a red"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9988,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "深红色的衣服\nshēn hóng sè de yī fú\ndark red outfit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13668,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "红色,红色的衣服\nhóng sè, hóng sè de yī fú\nRed, red clothing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18308,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为我约了朋友见面\nyīn wèi wǒ yuē le péng yǒu jiàn miàn\nBecause I made plans to meet a friend."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23908,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你们猜猜\nnǐ men cāi cāi\nCan you guess"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26428,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我要和朋友一起做什么呢?\nwǒ yào hé péng yǒu yī qǐ zuò shén me ne ?\nwhat I'm going to do with my friend?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32828,
    "dDurationMs": 4852,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "待会儿你们就会知道了\ndài huì ér nǐ men jiù huì zhī dào le\nYou'll find out in a bit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39607,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我现在在电梯\nwǒ xiàn zài zài diàn tī\nI'm in the elevator now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44007,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
