    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48847,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我要去一个地方\nwǒ yào qù yí gè dì fāng\nI'm going to a place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54367,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我要找一找\nwǒ yào zhǎo yī zhǎo\nI'm going to look for it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59887,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "今天我约了朋友打麻将\njīn tiān wǒ yuē le péng yǒu dǎ má jiāng\nToday I made plans to play mahjong with a friend."
