    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "一副整齐的麻将\nyī fù zhěng qí de má jiāng\nset of neatly arranged mahjong tiles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 397354,
    "dDurationMs": 4991,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "现在有了一副整齐的麻将\nxiàn zài yǒu le yī fù zhěng qí de má jiāng\nNow we have a set of neatly arranged mahjong tiles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403074,
    "dDurationMs": 3068,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "机器现在在里面\njī qì xiàn zài zài lǐ miàn\nThe machine is inside now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 406274,
    "dDurationMs": 1782,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "在里面洗\nzài lǐ miàn xǐ\nwashing inside."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408132,
    "dDurationMs": 2422,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "在里面洗麻将\nzài lǐ miàn xǐ má jiāng\nwashing the mahjong tiles inside."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 411434,
    "dDurationMs": 5635,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为一台机器有两副麻将\nyīn wèi yī tái jī qì yǒu liǎng fù má jiāng\nBecause one machine has two sets of mahjong tiles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417274,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "有两副麻将\nyǒu liǎng fù má jiāng\nThere are two sets of mahjong tiles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420114,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它现在在里面\ntā xiàn zài zài lǐ miàn\nIt's inside now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 422954,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "在里面洗另外一副\nzài lǐ miàn xǐ lìng wài yī fù\nwashing the other set inside."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 427248,
    "dDurationMs": 2001,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我的朋友们\nwǒ de péng yǒu mén\nMy friends"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 430248,
    "dDurationMs": 6040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "另外三位朋友都还没到\nlìng wài sān wèi péng yǒu dū huán méi dào\nThe other three friends still haven't arrived."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 436848,
    "dDurationMs": 5965,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "他们现在还没有到这里\ntā men xiàn zài huán méi yǒu dào zhè lǐ\nThey still aren't here yet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 443008,
    "dDurationMs": 2281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "所以我要等\nsuǒ yǐ wǒ yào děng\nSo I have to wait."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 445608,
    "dDurationMs": 2654,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "等他们\nděng tā men\nWait for them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 448488,
    "dDurationMs": 5882,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "等所有人四个人都到齐了\nděng suǒ yǒu rén sì gè rén dū dào qí le\nWait until all four people have arrived."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454624,
    "dDurationMs": 5033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "才可以开始打麻将\ncái kě yǐ kāi shǐ dǎ má jiāng\nbefore we can start playing mahjong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459968,
    "dDurationMs": 4834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为麻将就是要四个人\nyīn wèi má jiāng jiù shì yào sì gè rén\nBecause mahjong is a game that requires four people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 464866,
    "dDurationMs": 4446,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "才能开始玩的游戏\ncái néng kāi shǐ wán de yóu xì\nto be able to start playing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 469445,
    "dDurationMs": 4397,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我现在在等他们\nwǒ xiàn zài zài děng tā men\nI'm waiting for them now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 473888,
    "dDurationMs": 6320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "所以我有时间可以先跟你们\nsuǒ yǐ wǒ yǒu shí jiān kě yǐ xiān gēn nǐ men\nSo I have time to first talk to you about"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 480328,
    "dDurationMs": 4712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "说一说麻将的牌\nshuō yī shuō má jiāng de pái\nthe mahjong tiles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 485328,
    "dDurationMs": 4777,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这些麻将也叫做牌\nzhèi xiē má jiāng yě jiào zuò pái\nThese mahjong tiles are also called cards."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 490408,
    "dDurationMs": 3772,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "一张牌,两张,三张\nyī zhāng pái, liǎng zhāng, sān zhāng\nOne tile, two tiles, three tiles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 494408,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它们是麻将\ntā men shì má jiāng\nThey are mahjong tiles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 497328,
    "dDurationMs": 5644,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "但是我们也会把它们叫做牌\ndàn shì wǒ men yě huì bǎ tā men jiào zuò pái\nBut we also call them tiles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 503068,
    "dDurationMs": 4695,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我可以给你们介绍一下\nwǒ kě yǐ gěi nǐ men jiè shào yī xià\nI can introduce to you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 507848,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这些麻将牌的中文怎么说\nzhèi xiē má jiāng pái de zhōng wén zěn mó shuō\nhow to say these mahjong tiles in Chinese."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 514355,
    "dDurationMs": 4317,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "在中国大部分麻将\nzài zhōng guó dà bù fèn má jiāng\nIn China, most mahjong sets"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 518728,
    "dDurationMs": 5046,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "都是由这些牌组成的\ndū shì yóu zhèi xiē pái zǔ chéng de\nare made up of these tiles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 524075,
    "dDurationMs": 5555,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这一排叫做万子\nzhè yī pái jiào zuò wàn zǐ\nThis row is called the characters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 529722,
    "dDurationMs": 1205,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "万子\nwàn zǐ\nCharacters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 531195,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为它们是一万\nyīn wèi tā men shì yī wàn\nBecause they are one ten thousand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 535835,
    "dDurationMs": 720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "两万\nliǎng wàn\ntwo ten thousand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 537115,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "三万\nsān wàn\nthree ten thousand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 538515,
    "dDurationMs": 440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "四万\nsì wàn\nfour ten thousand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 540075,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "五,六,七,八,九万\nwǔ, liù, qī, bā, jiǔ wàn\nfive, six, seven, eight, nine ten thousand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 544435,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "九张万子牌\njiǔ zhāng wàn zǐ pái\nNine character tiles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 550675,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "所以这些是万子\nsuǒ yǐ zhèi xiē shì wàn zǐ\nSo these are the characters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 555435,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "万,九万\nwàn, jiǔ wàn\nTen thousand, nine ten thousand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 558127,
    "dDurationMs": 6250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "第二排,这一排叫做筒\ndì èr pái, zhè yī pái jiào zuò tǒng\nThe second row, this row, is called circles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 564915,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "比如这是一筒\nbǐ rú zhè shì yī tǒng\nFor example, this is one circle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 568355,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "二筒\nèr tǒng\ntwo circles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 569955,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "三筒\nsān tǒng\nthree circles."
    } ]
  }, {
