  }, {
    "tStartMs": 592515,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "筒子牌\ntǒng zǐ pái\nCircle tiles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 594195,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "它们都是九,从一到九\ntā men dū shì jiǔ, cóng yī dào jiǔ\nThey all go from one to nine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 599115,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "一万到九万\nyī wàn dào jiǔ wàn\nOne ten thousand to nine ten thousand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 601515,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "一筒到九筒\nyī tǒng dào jiǔ tǒng\nOne circle to nine circles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 604419,
    "dDurationMs": 7216,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "筒子牌的上面这一牌叫做条子\ntǒng zǐ pái de shàng miàn zhè yī pái jiào zuò tiáo zǐ\nThe row above the circle tiles is called bamboo."
