  }, {
    "tStartMs": 620410,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "六七八九\nliù qī bā jiǔ\nsix, seven, eight, nine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 623010,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "其实就是它们上面的图案\nqí shí jiù shì tā men shàng miàn de tú àn\nActually, it's the patterns on them."
