  }, {
    "tStartMs": 627010,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这个图案\nzhè gè tú àn\nThis pattern."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 628530,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "比如这有六个筒\nbǐ rú zhè yǒu liù gè tǒng\nFor example, this has six circles."
