  }, {
    "tStartMs": 710290,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "白板牌\nbái bǎn pái\nWhite dragon tile"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 712610,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我们叫做白板牌\nwǒ men jiào zuò bái bǎn pái\nWe call it the white dragon tile"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 716010,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "那整副麻将牌\nnà zhěng fù má jiāng pái\nThen the whole mahjong set"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 719690,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "基本是由这些牌\njī běn shì yóu zhèi xiē pái\nis basically made up of these tiles"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 723770,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这些万子\nzhèi xiē wàn zǐ\nThese character tiles"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 725450,
    "dDurationMs": 640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "筒子\ntǒng zǐ\nCircle tiles"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 726290,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "条子和汉字的这些牌组成的\ntiáo zǐ hé hàn zì de zhèi xiē pái zǔ chéng de\nand bamboo tiles, along with the character tiles"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 731450,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "因为中国有很多城市\nyīn wèi zhōng guó yǒu hěn duō chéng shì\nBecause there are many cities in China"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 735690,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "每个城市打麻将的规矩\nměi gè chéng shì dǎ má jiāng de guī jǔ\nand every city has different mahjong customs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 740690,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "规则不一样\nguī zé bù yī yàng\nthe rules are different"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 743290,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "所以有时候牌也会不太一样\nsuǒ yǐ yǒu shí hòu pái yě huì bù tài yī yàng\nso sometimes the tiles are a little different too"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 749530,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "比如有些人打麻将\nbǐ rú yǒu xiē rén dǎ má jiāng\nFor example, some people play mahjong"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 753450,
    "dDurationMs": 720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "不要\nbú yào\ndon’t want"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 754770,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "不要这些汉字\nbú yào zhèi xiē hàn zì\ndon’t want these character tiles"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 757850,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "不要这些有汉字的牌\nbú yào zhèi xiē yǒu hàn zì de pái\ndon’t want these tiles with characters on them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 761610,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "他们只用这些\ntā men zhī yòng zhèi xiē\nthey only use these"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 764850,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "所以这就是麻将\nsuǒ yǐ zhè jiù shì má jiāng\nSo this is mahjong"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 768690,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "麻将的牌\nmá jiāng de pái\nMahjong tiles"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 771530,
    "dDurationMs": 480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "牌\npái\ntile"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 772898,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这是骰子\nzhè shì tóu zǐ\nThis is the dice"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 775458,
    "dDurationMs": 160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "骰子\ntóu zǐ\nDice"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 775978,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这里面有两颗骰子\nzhè lǐ miàn yǒu liǎng kē tóu zǐ\nThere are two dice in here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 780298,
    "dDurationMs": 1752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "有一个按钮\nyǒu yí gè àn niǔ\nThere is a button"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 782050,
    "dDurationMs": 1074,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "按钮\nàn niǔ\nButton"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 783214,
    "dDurationMs": 1444,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我按一下\nwǒ àn yī xià\nI press it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 784898,
    "dDurationMs": 720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "打骰\ndǎ tóu\nroll the dice"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 786218,
    "dDurationMs": 440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "打骰\ndǎ tóu\nroll the dice"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 786658,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "摇骰子\nyáo tóu zǐ\nshake the dice"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 788658,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我按一下\nwǒ àn yī xià\nI press it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 794058,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "骰子的结果\ntóu zǐ de jié guǒ\nThe result of the dice"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 796218,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "然后我要摸牌\nrán hòu wǒ yào mō pái\nThen I’m going to draw a tile"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 798138,
    "dDurationMs": 520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "拿牌\nná pái\ntake a tile"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 798658,
    "dDurationMs": 921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "从哪里开始\ncóng nǎ lǐ kāi shǐ\nWhere do we start"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 799579,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "现在每个人拿自己的牌\nxiàn zài měi gè rén ná zì jǐ de pái\nNow everyone takes their own tiles"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 806939,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "每人13\nměi rén 13\n13 per person"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 808859,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "13张牌\n13 zhāng pái\n13 tiles"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 813339,
    "dDurationMs": 561,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "跳了对不对\ntiào le duì bù duì\nIt skipped, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 817499,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这些就是我的牌\nzhèi xiē jiù shì wǒ de pái\nThese are my tiles"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 821739,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "现在轮到我摸牌\nxiàn zài lún dào wǒ mō pái\nNow it’s my turn to draw"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 823859,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我摸牌\nwǒ mō pái\nI draw a tile"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 824859,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "拿一张牌就叫摸牌\nná yī zhāng pái jiù jiào mō pái\nTaking one tile is called drawing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 828179,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "摸了一张牌要出\nmō le yī zhāng pái yào chū\nAfter drawing a tile, you have to discard"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 830859,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "出掉一张牌\nchū diào yī zhāng pái\ndiscard one tile"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 833819,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "保持自己的牌是13张\nbǎo chí zì jǐ de pái shì 13 zhāng\nkeep your hand at 13 tiles"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 837859,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "13张牌\n13 zhāng pái\n13 tiles"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 840419,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "出牌和摸牌\nchū pái hé mō pái\nDiscarding and drawing tiles"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 845019,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "现在轮到我的下家\nxiàn zài lún dào wǒ de xià jiā\nNow it’s my next player’s turn"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 847859,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "出牌\nchū pái\ndiscard a tile"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 849339,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "他出了一张三筒\ntā chū le yī zhāng sān tǒng\nHe discarded a 3 of circles"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 854271,
    "dDurationMs": 2066,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我胡牌了\nwǒ hú pái le\nI won by mahjong"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 856568,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "现在我的牌\nxiàn zài wǒ de pái\nNow my hand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 858408,
    "dDurationMs": 4462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我刚刚摸了六索,六条,六条\nwǒ gāng gāng mō le liù suǒ, liù tiáo, liù tiáo\nI just drew a 6 bamboo, 6 bamboo, 6 bamboo"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 863558,
    "dDurationMs": 6356,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "现在我的牌凑成了胡牌的牌式\nxiàn zài wǒ de pái còu chéng le hú pái de pái shì\nNow my hand forms a winning hand pattern"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 870474,
    "dDurationMs": 2731,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "所以我属于自摸\nsuǒ yǐ wǒ shǔ yú zì mō\nSo I won by self-draw"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 873325,
    "dDurationMs": 2279,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我自摸胡牌\nwǒ zì mō hú pái\nI won by self-draw"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 875684,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这就是胡牌\nzhè jiù shì hú pái\nThis is winning mahjong"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 894626,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "我现在打完麻将了\nwǒ xiàn zài dǎ wán má jiāng le\nI’ve finished playing mahjong now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 898826,
    "dDurationMs": 6880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你们猜猜我今天是赢了还是输了?\nnǐ men cāi cāi wǒ jīn tiān shì yíng le hái shì shū le ?\nGuess whether I won or lost today?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 906386,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你们会打麻将吗?\nnǐ men huì dǎ má jiāng ma ?\nDo you play mahjong?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 909948,
    "dDurationMs": 6800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你们想学学中国麻将怎么打吗?\nnǐ men xiǎng xué xué zhōng guó má jiāng zěn me dǎ ma ?\nDo you want to learn how to play Chinese mahjong?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 917188,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "可以在下面的评论区告诉我\nkě yǐ zài xià miàn de píng lùn qū gào sù wǒ\nYou can tell me in the comments below"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 922268,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "谢谢观看,下个视频再见!\nxiè xiè guān kàn, xià gè shì pín zài jiàn !\nThanks for watching, see you in the next video!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 927532,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你们会打麻将吗?\nnǐ men huì dǎ má jiāng ma ?\nDo you play mahjong?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 931452,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "你们想...\nnǐ men xiǎng...\nDo you want to..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 933372,
    "dDurationMs": 160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "哇!\nwā !\nWow!"
    } ]
  } ]
}
